# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the nightly's TSan build (nightly.yml).
#
# vcpkg builds OpenCV without TSan, and its parallel_for runs on pthreads that
# TSan cannot see synchronise, so it reports races inside OpenCV's own code
# (contours_truco.cpp: approxContour, in a first run, on every case that reads
# a side). A race that lies inside OpenCV is OpenCV's, or an artefact of the
# missing instrumentation; a race in this repository's code that merely calls
# OpenCV still has its own frames and is not matched by these.
race:cv::
